tools/__pycache__/

# full-resolution card masters (~7 MB each). The tracked source of truth is the
# 350x600 set in cards/, which is all tools/build_deck.py consumes.
watermark-removed-*.png

# ...and nothing should ever put that set back under public/. It was a byte-for-
# byte copy of cards/ (79 files, 7.5 MB) that no browser ever requested: the deck
# reads its art from the atlas in public/textures/, never from per-card files.
/public/cards/
